    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Sleeping well",
     "texto": [
      "**Sueño** is part of health. A good **rutina** has a fixed **horario**: **acostarse** and getting up at the same time.\n\n- The **despertador** rings in the morning.\n- A short **siesta** can be a good **descanso**.\n- If you sleep little, **cansancio** arrives.\n- A **hábito saludable** is something good that you do every day.\n- To sleep better, you have to **reducir** screen time.\n\nTo give opinions and advice: **es evidente que**, **es necesario que**, **hay que**, **deberíamos**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "gramatica",
     "titulo": "Giving opinions and advice",
     "texto": [
      "To give an opinion or advice there are four formulas:\n\n- **Es evidente que** + indicative, if something is a fact: **es evidente que dormir bien ayuda**.\n- **Es necesario que** + subjunctive, if you talk about what a person must do: **es necesario que descansemos más**.\n- **Hay que** + infinitive, for everyone in general: **hay que acostarse temprano**.\n- **Deberíamos** + infinitive, for friendly advice: **deberíamos leer un libro**.\n\nThe subjunctive is built from **yo**: reduzco → **reduzcamos**; duermo → **durmamos**."
     ],
     "ejemplos": [
